# Hashing

# Definition:
# - Original data ko fixed-length code me convert karna Hashing kehlata hai.

# Purpose:
# - Password ko secure rakhna.

# Flow:
# Password
# ↓
# Hash Function
# ↓
# Hash Code
# ↓
# Database

# Properties:
# 1. Fixed Length
# 2. One Way
# 3. Same Input = Same Hash
# 4. Different Input = Different Hash

# Node.js Library:
# bcrypt

# Register:
# Password → Hash → Database

# Login:
# Password → Hash → Compare → Login Success

# Difference:
# Hashing = One Way
# Encryption = Two Way



# bcrypt.hashSync(password, 10)

# password
# - Jo password hash karna hai.

# 10
# - Salt Rounds.
# - Jitna bada number, utni zyada security.
# - Lekin hashing me utna hi zyada time lagega.

# Common Values:
# 8  -> Fast
# 10 -> Most Common (Recommended)
# 12 -> More Secure